 grammar:()=>`
 <div class="gram"><h4>To whom? Кому? (dative)</h4>
 <div class="ig-tldr">Giving <b>to</b> someone: он-words add <b>-у</b>, она-words change <b>-а → -е</b>.</div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip m">брат</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">брат<b>у</b></span><span class="ig-chip m">Дима</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">Дим<b>е</b></span></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip f">мама</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">мам<b>е</b></span><span class="ig-chip f">подруга</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">подруг<b>е</b></span></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip">Я дарю</span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip hl">маме<small>to whom</small></span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip">цветы<small>what</small></span></div>
 <div class="ig-memo"><i>👨‍👦</i><p><b>папа, Дима, дедушка</b> look feminine (-а), so they take <b>-е</b> too: папе, Диме, дедушке.</p></div></div>
 <div class="gram"><h4>“I like” = “It pleases me”</h4>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip hl">Мне<small>to me</small></span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip">нравится<small>is pleasing</small></span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip">Москва</span></div>
 <div class="ig-vs"><div><h5>1️⃣ one thing</h5><p>Мне <b class="hl">нравится</b> этот подарок.</p></div><div><h5>🔢 many things</h5><p>Ей <b class="hl">нравятся</b> цветы.</p></div></div>
 <div class="ig-memo"><i>❤️</i><p><b>люблю</b> = love (strong, long-term). <b>нравится</b> = like (and first impressions).</p></div></div>
 <div class="gram"><h4>Congratulations & wishes</h4>
 <div class="ig-cards"><div class="ig-card"><i>🎂</i><b>С днём рождения!</b><small>Happy birthday!</small></div><div class="ig-card"><i>🎄</i><b>С Новым годом!</b><small>Happy New Year!</small></div><div class="ig-card"><i>🌷</i><b>С Наурызом!</b><small>Happy Nauryz!</small></div><div class="ig-card"><i>🎉</i><b>С праздником!</b><small>Happy holiday!</small></div></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip hl">Желаю</span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip">счастья</span><span class="ig-chip">здоровья</span><span class="ig-chip">успехов</span></div>
 <div class="ig-dont">Я нравлюсь цветы.</div><div class="ig-do">Мне нравятся цветы.</div></div>`,
